No GPL Dependencies:
--------------------
As of 2026-06-23 the compiled binaries link no GPL-licensed libraries. The
correlation engine uses a permissive self-owned codelet FFT (FFTW3 removed),
and the ensemble fitter is pure NumPy (the GSL-based fitters were removed).
The two C libraries (libbulkxcorr2d, libfusedwarp) link only OpenMP and libm.

Other Dependencies:
-------------------
This software uses various third-party open-source libraries (NumPy, SciPy,
OpenCV, Flask, etc.) which are distributed under permissive licenses (BSD,
MIT, Apache 2.0). See each package's documentation for specific license terms.
